# The cable car slot down Powell St (city phase 11): the slot between the rails of each cable car track
# is a grind line, flush with the street like the F-line's rails. Rolling down Powell from the top of
# its kept block (the squeezed city keeps it from Ellis) toward the turntable at 5 m/s beside the slot, an ollie and grind pressed in the air: a 50-50 in
# the slot, ridden down the hill (the balance bot keeps it; 12 s and 45 m on, still in the slot).
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 teleport 586.26 520.14 -6.30 171.0
cmd 2 set skater.vel.x 0.78
cmd 2 set skater.vel.y -4.94
hold ollie 30..40
tap grind 46
bot balance
run 1500
expect event grindStart{trick=FS 50-50,line=slot_585_522} within 45..49
expect skater.state == grind at 1500
expect skater.pos.y < 478.2 at 1500
expect no event bail
